<title>NETHERLANDS: VNU first-half net profit 143 mln guilders.</title>
<headline>VNU first-half net profit 143 mln guilders.</headline>
<dateline>HAARLEM, Netherlands 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>First half of 1996.</p>
<p>(millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit from ordinary ops		143  vs  126</p>
<p>    Ditto per share (guilders)		 0.75  vs  0.66</p>
<p>    Extraordinary gain			    nil  vs  160</p>
<p>    Net profit incl. extraordinaries	  143  vs  286</p>
<p>    Turnover (billions)			  1.64  vs  1.44</p>
<p>    Total operating costs (billions)	 1.43  vs  1.29</p>
<p>    Operating profit				202  vs  152</p>
<p>    Income from associates			  6  vs  39</p>
<p>    Net financial charges			   4  vs  10</p>
<p>    Taxes						61  vs  55</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had expected publisher VNU to report a first-half net profit from ordinary operations of 132 to 148 million guilders. The consensus estimate was 139 million.  </p>
<p>VNU operating costs in detail</p>
<p>    Raw materials				   371  vs  319</p>
<p>    Purchased services			    265  vs  235</p>
<p>    Personnel					 467  vs  424</p>
<p>    Depreciation/amortisation		    45  vs   51</p>
<p>    Other expenses				  286  vs  258</p>
<p>    Total (billions)			     1.43  vs  1.29</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
